<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>About the Gallery</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav class="navbar bg-dark navbar-dark">
      <div class="container">
        <a class="navbar-brand" href="/characters">Mythic Atlas</a>
        <div class="navbar-nav flex-row gap-3">
          <a class="nav-link" href="/characters">Home</a>
          <a class="nav-link active" href="/characters/about">About</a>
          <a class="nav-link" href="/characters/add">Add a Character</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="py-4 border-bottom">
      <div class="container">
        <h1 class="display-6 fw-bold">About This Mythology Gallery</h1>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="py-5">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row g-4 align-items-center">
          <div class="col-lg-6">
            <img src="https://th-thumbnailer.cdn-si-edu.com/C5QqPZWvuXyKY-dwvctoXzw6WKY=/1000x750/filters:no_upscale():focal(282x171:283x172)/https://tf-cmsv2-smithsonianmag-media.s3.amazonaws.com/filer/d0/b1/d0b150e5-ca51-4300-a0fc-c940f1999027/myth_mobile.jpg" alt="Ancient map illustration" class="img-fluid rounded-3 border">
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-6">
            <p>Mythologies from Mesopotamia, Greece, Norse traditions, and Japan explore how people explain power, nature, and the limits of human life. These stories blend heroism, divine conflict, and moral choices to express what a culture values.</p>
            <p>Gilgamesh reflects a ruler who learns humility through loss, while heroes like Heracles show endurance through trials. Deities such as Athena, Odin, and Amaterasu represent wisdom, sacrifice, and the life-giving force of light.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">Across these myths, common themes appear, such as the search for meaning, the tension between fate and choice, and the belief that stories can guide communities through uncertainty.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>


    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
